  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Awareness Raising and Capacity Building on Climate Justice</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This Project is proposed to be implemented by the United Nations Development Programme (UNDP) in partnership with the relevant public institutions and academia. This project initiation plan (PIP) aims to benefit T&#xfc;rkiye in the field of climate governance through increasing capacities of actors, designing informative trainings on environmental law, and raising awareness among practitioners and youth on issues related to climate justice.</narrative>
  </description>
